{
 "title": "if let und while let",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "Interessiert dich nur eine Variante, kannst du **`if let`** statt `match` schreiben: Passt das Muster, wird es an die Variable gebunden und der Block läuft, sonst läuft `else`."
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn main():",
    "    maybe: Optional[i32] = Valid(42)",
    "    if let Valid(x) = maybe:",
    "        print(\"found\", x)",
    "    else:",
    "        print(\"nothing\")",
    "",
    "    none_here: Optional[i32] = None",
    "    if let Valid(y) = none_here:",
    "        print(\"found\", y)",
    "    else:",
    "        print(\"nothing\")"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "found 42",
    "nothing"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "**`while let`** läuft, solange das Muster passt. `List.pop()` liefert `Valid(element)`, bis die Liste leer ist, dann `None`."
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn main():",
    "    stack = List[str]()",
    "    stack.push(\"first\")",
    "    stack.push(\"second\")",
    "    stack.push(\"third\")",
    "    while let Valid(item) = stack.pop():",
    "        print(\"popped:\", item)"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "popped: third",
    "popped: second",
    "popped: first"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c08-l05-x1",
   "prompt": "Verbrauche mit `while let` und `pop` die Zahlen der Liste `nums` und gib ihre Summe aus.",
   "starter": [
    "fn main():",
    "    nums = List[i32]()",
    "    nums.push(4)",
    "    nums.push(5)",
    "    nums.push(6)",
    "    total = 0",
    "    print(total)"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "fn main():",
    "    nums = List[i32]()",
    "    nums.push(4)",
    "    nums.push(5)",
    "    nums.push(6)",
    "    total = 0",
    "    while let Valid(n) = nums.pop():",
    "        total += n",
    "    print(total)"
   ],
   "hint": "Führe `total += n` innerhalb von `while let Valid(n) = nums.pop():` aus.",
   "expected": [
    "15"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c08-l05-q1",
   "q": "Wann hört `while let` auf?",
   "options": [
    "Nach 10 Runden",
    "Wenn das Muster nicht mehr passt (z. B. `pop()` liefert `None`)",
    "Nie"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "why": "Die Schleife endet, wenn der Abgleich fehlschlägt."
  }
 ]
}
